        "v2-retries-async",
        "v2-retries-scripted"
      ],
      "clause": "#542 \u00a73: preserve category-specific retry counts and conclusive camera-error retry classification while making replay depend on correlation evidence.",
      "rationale": "2.0 keeps the category retry-count table and bounded exponential scheduling, but sizes one admission-to-terminal budget from the governing deadline and profile busy timeout. Sony ambiguity may retry only with the same sequence; an ambiguous successfully sent raw command poisons the session instead of being replayed."
    },
