      ],
      "clause": "#542 \u00a73: preserve bounded retry behavior while allowing an explicit 2.0 scheduling improvement.",
      "rationale": "1.x computes an exact exponential delay with no jitter. 2.0 uses a 50ms initial delay and deterministic equal jitter within a bounded ceiling, preventing synchronized retries while remaining reproducible. Retry counts remain category-based and the total budget follows the separate evidence-bounded retry decision."
